      "writtenOn": "2026-06-22T16:07:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is the correct behavior; it prevents the race condition where, without a barrier after the assignment, some threads may assign `result` proceed, and overwrite `p` before all threads in the workgroup have made their assignment to `result`.",
      "parentUuid": "a456f6a1_c01feb05",
